---
import { TrendingUp, ShieldCheck, Users, Radar, Box } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl 4xl:max-w-7xl my-5 md:my-12 lg:my-16 xl:my-20 2xl:my-24">
        <div class="col-center gap-0.5">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-full fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-3.5 md:w-4 4xl:w-5">
                    <Box stroke-width={2} class="w-full text-gray-800" />
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] md:text-[13px] 4xl:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    About
                </h4>
            </span>
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                About Warehouster Group
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base 2xl:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                Warehouster is India’s integrated logistics asset partner—specializing in acquisition, development, and portfolio management for global and domestic investors.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5 fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-9 xl:w-10 3xl:w-11 text-[var(--primary-color)] pb-7">
                        <TrendingUp size="100%" stroke-width={1}  />
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Agile Growth</h3>
                        <p class="xl:text-lg 4xl:text-xl leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Warehouster positions itself as a strategic growth partner, embracing agility not just in operations but in how they collaborate with clients. Their infrastructure and decision-making are designed to adapt quickly to evolving supply chain demands.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-9 xl:w-10 3xl:w-11 text-[var(--primary-color)] pb-7">
                        <ShieldCheck size="100%" stroke-width={1}  />
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Regulatory Excellence</h3>
                        <p class="xl:text-lg 4xl:text-xl leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            They maintain high standards of compliance and regulatory alignment, ensuring that their logistics parks meet all statutory norms. This builds trust with institutional clients and supports long-term, risk-mitigated operations.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5 fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-full md:w-2/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-9 xl:w-10 3xl:w-11 text-[var(--primary-color)] pb-7">
                        <Radar size="100%" stroke-width={1}  />
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Future Focus</h3>
                        <p class="xl:text-lg 4xl:text-xl leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Warehouster emphasizes scalable, future-proof logistics ecosystems. Their developments are planned with long-term adaptability in mind—supporting automation, sustainability, and evolving distribution models.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-9 xl:w-10 3xl:w-11 text-[var(--primary-color)] pb-7">
                        <Users size="100%" stroke-width={1}  />
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Collaborative Edge</h3>
                        <p class="xl:text-lg 4xl:text-xl leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Rather than just building warehouses, Warehouster fosters ecosystems where tenants, developers, and logistics operators co-create value. Their approach encourages modularity, shared resources, and operational synergy across industries.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>